y case..oh, you just logged in. mailing this right now. :)Loving spanks,-Tom**silas**To: schpankaySubj: FutureworldDate: Oct  5I rented it last night and almost fainted as I watched the dream sequencewith Yul. Imagining myself in the female reporters' place I myself was whiskedinto a world of fantasy...Tomworld, if you will.Definitely on a philosophical kick today,-Tom**silas**To: schpankaySubj: ThingsDate: Oct 15First of all I'm sorry I've kept missing you over the past few days;we always seem to be on at different times. :) I took the test todayand got a 9 on it (need 14 to pass). The recruiter insisted that it wasa great score for someone who had no programming backgroundand said that I could take it over Thursday. She'll also be callingthe local branch office so I can use some of their computer trainingprograms tomorrow and Wednesday. So things are back to the usual withme still hanging in limbo.Hope things are less hectic with you! ;)Loving spanks,-Tom**jimpa**To: schpankay Re:   jew!\\Date: Oct 17i consulted my calender yoyo mommaand i had taken the weekend of the 15-17 off to come down to bloomington anywaysooooooooooooo what time is the concert cause i have todrive back later at night .. OR reallll early the next morning to make work at 10 amit will be daylght savings time there toso that will giveme a hour i thinkhumm i make another apointment for skin doctori go. i thinki go sleepy now. i work 13 hours today, my feet hurt. i work 13-14 hours tojorrowand 12 friday... but i havesaturday off but that fucking bitch has the store meeting at 8:30 am saturdayCUNTfirst saturday off in over 2 months and the fucking bitch pulls this trickHATE HERI HATE I HATEi am gonna show up looking mighty prettyso when i found out i called off 3 saturdays in the next 4 weeks. shecan kiss my ass the bitchi love youi'm hungry and kinda sickyi no drink nuff water today and i have cold and am dehydratedoooggieis t