o them.  listen toyour heart...dont let anyone else cloud what you feel-for me and whatever else.for a long time you have been my raison d'etre, you made me feel special andworth something.  maybe i need some time to try to get that for myself...but i know that at the end, our journeys will merge and it will come togetheragain.  and i dont want you to feel like i am trying to hang ontosomething that isnt there, its still there, for whatever reason you are trying to deny it.  think hard, think long and seriously...search yourself,think of robyn and i, think of you and i, think of all we've been through andbeen to each other.  dont turn to someone else right now in your search,it wont help down the road.  we still belong together, it's right.i will send you something from robyn, i want you to keep it to yourself,dont share that and dirty it with someones else's comments and agendas.i miss your touch, i miss your voice, i miss scratching your head.  i knowyou must miss me too.  if you cant think of me right now, think of robyn.dont just think of yourself.  she's 3, and her memories are fleeting, lifeneeds to be stable for her.  i cant be it all, i cant do it all for her.she needs your influence, your hugs, you love to make her a whole child.dont wait too long...lovedanielleps do you know where my toenail clippers are??**jimpa**To: schpankaySubj: mailDate: Dec  8everyone wants maili want mail, you want mail so here's some maili'm hungeeeeeeeeschpppaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa-birdiei found something of yours, umnot clothing but something else, and i think your gonna hit mecawl me later i'll tell you, it must have been put in my room by mistake I DIDN'T KNOW!!!!!your taering me APART~i wuv youbuh byweme**sytar**To: schpankaySubj: sorryDate: Dec  8Hi :)Sorry, I was writing a mail when you talked at me.I hope you'll get that book and videocasette somewhere.Did you tryed to found it on the Internet? I'll look round, I